┌── Log ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Leave it where it is. Sit down, kid. There's something in my coat that I've spent all  │
│           morning not giving you.                                                                │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           A peddler left it last night. No seal, no name. It didn't need one. I'd know that      │
│           handwriting anywhere, and so will you.                                                 │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           "Leave the march. Tonight. They are coming for everyone who was there that night.      │
│           Burn this."                                                                            │
│                                                                                                  │
│ ▶         Ellery                                                                                 │
│           Dace.                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Four years. Not a line to you. Not one to his own father. And when he finally writes,  │
│           it's that.                                                                             │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Ellery                                                                                 │
│           > Four years of silence, and now he's urgent.                                          │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────── arrows move · f go to this line · d close ──┘
